# The build context is this directory (the workspace root), so these patterns
# must match inside every workspace package too.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/build
**/.docusaurus
# NOTE: do not ignore **/.storybook — apps/storybook builds inside its image and needs its config.
.idea
.git
.gitignore
*.md
**/*.md
